{"title": "Feather Token", "pageid": 28207, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Feather_Token", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Feather_Token_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Feather_Token_Faded.png/300px-Feather_Token_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/58/Feather_Token_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Feather Token image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Feather_Token_Faded.png/300px-Feather_Token_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Feather_Token_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Feather Token</b> is a miscellaneous item found in a coffin in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>. It claims to be able to protect its bearer from steep falls.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>If you fall while carrying this token, you take no Falling damage. The token's magic is expended after you land, whereupon the disk becomes non-magical.\n<br>\nA small, faded feather is stamped on one side of this surprisingly light coin.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from a mahogany coffin in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mortuary\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mortuary\">Mortuary</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;40&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;28</span></li>\n<li>Looted from a skeleton inside a broken section of wall in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Durinbold_Mausoleum\" title=\"Durinbold Mausoleum\">Durinbold Mausoleum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;32&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;18</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item's flavor text is unusual, as it appears to break the fourth wall and describe game mechanics directly, including deliberate capitalization of the word \"Falling\" similar to the descriptive text of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall\" title=\"Feather Fall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/38px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/50px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall\" title=\"Feather Fall\">Feather Fall</a>.</li>\n<li>Falling with the Feather Token in your inventory will <i>not</i> protect you from fall damage.\n<ul><li>Speculatively, this may be a trace of a discarded mechanic that was not implemented in the final game.</li>\n<li>Narratively, this also implies that the Feather Token's previous carrier had expended its magical use. Since the item is found in a coffin and on a skeleton, it's possible that it didn't work for them, either.</li>\n<li>One of two items in the game that imply a magical effect but provide no benefit; the other is the <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Misty_Step\" title=\"Potion of Misty Step\">Potion of Misty Step</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Feather Tokens are a classic magic item from tabletop D&amp;D that come in several varieties with different effects. Most are used by throwing them into the air, whereupon they transform into something useful; however, one version, described in the sourcebook <i>Eberron: Rising from the Last War</i>, does provide protection from fall damage.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214204\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1159/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13356/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5800/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754580/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.367      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   29.367      1 -total\n 32.96%    9.680      5 Template:Icon_text\n 25.24%    7.414     10 Template:Trim\n 23.87%    7.010      1 Template:Main_only\n 21.08%    6.191      2 Template:Icon_link\n 14.56%    4.275      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.22%    4.175      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.05%    4.125      5 Template:Ifempty\n  8.75%    2.569      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28207-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214204 and revision id 239285. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}